  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat, about 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the salmon fillets with smoked paprika, garlic powder, dried thyme, salt, and black pepper",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking",
    "Place the salmon fillets on the grill and cook for 4 minutes per side, or until cooked through",
    "Transfer the salmon to a plate and drizzle with yuzu juice",
    "Serve the salmon hot with lemon wedges on the side",
    "Garnish with fresh herbs, such as parsley or dill, for added flavor and color"
